WEBVTT

00:07:58.856 --> 00:08:01.448
je sveobuhvatno tačno ono što sam naumila.

00:08:01.448 --> 00:08:03.731
(Smeh)

00:08:03.731 --> 00:08:06.668
Znam da je ovo TED govor,

00:08:06.668 --> 00:08:10.417
ali sad ću da TED pevam.

00:08:10.417 --> 00:08:12.576
Ovo je pesma koju sam napisala
prošle godine.

00:08:12.576 --> 00:08:14.374
Hvala vam mnogo, Hvala vam.

00:08:14.374 --> 00:08:19.548
(Aplauz)

00:08:27.321 --> 00:08:33.180
(Klavir)